      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Pan Vrublevsky",
      "quote": "“What are you shouting for? D’you want to split your throat?” he said, addressing Vrublevsky, with surprising rudeness. “Animal!” bellowed Pan Vrublevsky.",
